==== Program "P" used for calculating mass of singular ======= 8.55A
==== particle forms ==========================================
 
--------------------------------------------------------------------- 
MATTER UNIFIED, 1998, ISBN 91-973340-0-6, O. Tedenstig/Sweden   8.55
